# Prisma Instructions

When working in database files:

- Always run `npx prisma format` after editing `schema.prisma`
- Use `npx prisma migrate dev --name <description>` for schema changes
- Include `createdAt` and `updatedAt` on every model
- Use `@relation` with explicit relation names
- Add `@@index` for fields used in WHERE clauses
- Use `@default(uuid())` for id fields
- Document relations with comments above the field
